411
00:25:48,505 --> 00:25:52,384
♪ Amid shattered hopes
and regret ♪

412
00:25:52,467 --> 00:25:55,095
♪ That's how I've lived ♪

413
00:25:56,888 --> 00:25:58,974
♪ But now ♪

414
00:25:59,057 --> 00:26:04,104
♪ I'm running toward that
mysterious light ♪

415
00:26:05,563 --> 00:26:08,858
♪ Who am I, and where am I? ♪

416
00:26:08,942 --> 00:26:13,780
♪ Someone's calling me
from far away ♪

417
00:26:13,863 --> 00:26:17,158
♪ Who am I, and where am I? ♪

418
00:26:17,242 --> 00:26:22,205
♪ From now on, we'll only
move forward ♪

419
00:26:25,875 --> 00:26:27,627
♪ Everything depends
on how you look at it ♪

420
00:26:27,711 --> 00:26:30,088
♪ You and I,
everyone's the same ♪

421
00:26:30,171 --> 00:26:32,090
♪ The life I've been given
