426
00:26:40,307 --> 00:26:43,268
♪ Someday,
you'll be a new person ♪

427
00:26:52,694 --> 00:26:55,071
Lee Hyun-do, Kim Sung-jae

428
00:26:55,155 --> 00:26:57,615
Deux, 'We Are'!

429
00:27:01,328 --> 00:27:05,040
♪ So many hardships ♪

430
00:27:05,123 --> 00:27:07,917
♪ Though they brought me to my knees ♪

431
00:27:08,001 --> 00:27:09,127
Hyun-do, I love you!

432
00:27:09,210 --> 00:27:10,670
♪ For me ♪

433
00:27:10,754 --> 00:27:12,047
I love you!

434
00:27:13,840 --> 00:27:15,967
Sung-jae, I love you!

435
00:27:17,552 --> 00:27:21,639
♪ Amid shattered hopes
