443
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:52,420
♪ Now I want to tell everyone ♪

444
00:27:52,504 --> 00:27:54,756
♪ My hopes, my thoughts, my purpose ♪

445
00:27:54,839 --> 00:27:57,092
♪ Even if right now ♪

446
00:27:57,175 --> 00:27:59,177
♪ Things are hard,
